WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:09.820
I would like everybody t-, to uh, to try and laugh without smiling.

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.000
I just pictured Hannah doing this!

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.700
You're totally smiling!

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:25.280
I am not!
Hank: Do you want to see the replay?

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:25.920
Hank: You are.
Hannah: nooo

00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.480
I can't! I can't do it!

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:38.100
Flula: Oh biscuit.
Hank: I like how dead your eyes are.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.520
I want all girlfriends to tell me that after dates.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:45.060
I didn't think I would hate it as much as I do, but I hate it so much.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.400
I feel like I'm killing my heart.

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.320
What weird experiment are you putting me through right now?

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.860
Seems weird, like a creeper.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:52.040
Like you're going insane right?

00:00:57.180 --> 00:00:57.960
I cannot!

00:00:58.940 --> 00:00:59.880
Uh, nope.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:02.040
Ruba: Take three!
Hank: One more.

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:22.340
Hank: You're too good!
Mark: It's almost like I'm actually soulless.

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:25.620
I can't!

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:29.080
I'm so creeped out by myself, I can't even see my own face.

00:01:29.080 --> 00:01:30.200
Sounds like I'm crying!

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:35.400
Hank: You're smiling a lot!

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:38.880
Duuuuudeee

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:43.140
Trick's on you, I've never laughed in my life!

00:01:43.140 --> 00:01:46.560
And I just, you know, make that noise and everyone believes it.

00:01:48.640 --> 00:01:49.460
Oh that's easy!

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:58.720
Oooh, that's uncomfortable.

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:04.300
I feel sad.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:06.880
Wait, am I supposed to try to laugh without...

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:19.040
Err, no.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:34.700
It's so hard!

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.040
That's so weird!

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:37.320
Hank: That's good, that's good!

00:02:44.280 --> 00:02:46.140
Let's hope I didn't spit on your lens!

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:52.600
The whole laughing without smiling thing, it's been done before.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:56.500
And, it's something that the do in the VidCon office all the time to relieve stress,

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:57.680
to make each other laugh,

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:58.940
to make themselves laugh.

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:02.800
I think that's what I like about it, is a lot of the time, you start out fake laughing,

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:05.940
and then it makes you real laugh, and real laughing is nice.

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:11.120
And the VidCon team, right now, is in Anaheim doing all the checkups and visits and meetings and stuff

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.560
that we need to do getting ready for VidCon because it's happening

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:17.560
earlier this year, it's June 24th. You think I'd know!

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:20.020
June 23rd to 25th, so I was right.

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:20.940
Kind of.

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:24.740
If you like online video, VidCon is a thing that we do. I hope you can come.

00:03:24.740 --> 00:03:27.100
So glad I got to see all those people while I was in LA.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:30.260
They're all great, there's lots of them and I put links to all their channels in the description.

00:03:30.260 --> 00:03:34.160
And there was one person that you didn't see in the video laughing without smiling

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:38.980
so let's do that while I link to all the other collab videos that I was in while I was in LA,

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.700
the ones that have come out so far, at least.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:41.200
Here we go!

00:03:57.040 --> 00:03:58.180
John, I'll see you on Tuesday.

